> Using Fun_lib

```catala
declaration add
  content integer
  depends on x content integer, y content integer
  equals
    x + y

declaration scope T:
  output x content integer
  output y content integer

scope T:
  definition x equals add of 6, 3
  definition y equals 6 <Fun_lib.add> 3
  assertion (x = 9)
  assertion (y = 3)
```

```catala-test-cli
$ catala test-scope T
┌─[RESULT]─ T ─
│ x = 9
│ y = 3
└─
```
